sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Envoy Gateway<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker (EPP)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelSvr as Model Server Pods<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Sidecar as pd-sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Prefill as Prefill Worker<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Decode as Local Decode Worker<br/>8001/TCP HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Client,Decode: Flow 1: Inference Request Routing (Gateway Mode)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/80
    Gateway->>EPP: ext-proc gRPC stream<br/>Request headers + body<br/>TLS (self-signed)
    EPP->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool, Pods<br/>HTTPS/443 SA token
    K8sAPI-->>EPP: Pool config, Pod list
    EPP->>ModelSvr: Scrape /metrics<br/>HTTP (InsecureSkipVerify)
    ModelSvr-->>EPP: KV-cache util, queue depth,<br/>running requests, LoRA adapters
    Note over EPP: Filter → Score → Pick<br/>optimal endpoint
    EPP-->>Gateway: ext-proc response<br/>Selected endpoint header mutation
    Gateway->>ModelSvr: Forward request to<br/>selected model server<br/>HTTP/8000

    Note over Client,Decode: Flow 2: Disaggregated P/D Inference

    Gateway->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP(S)/8000 TLS 1.2+
    Sidecar->>Prefill: Forward prompt for<br/>KV-cache generation<br/>HTTP(S) TLS (configurable)
    Prefill-->>Sidecar: KV transfer params<br/>(NIXL V2 / Mooncake / SGLang)
    Sidecar->>Decode: Decode request +<br/>KV transfer params<br/>HTTP(S)/8001
    Decode-->>Sidecar: Streaming tokens (SSE)
    Sidecar-->>Gateway: Stream response
    Gateway-->>Client: Streaming tokens

    Note over Client,Decode: Flow 3: E/P/D Multimodal Disaggregated Inference

    participant Encode as Encode Workers<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    Gateway->>Sidecar: POST /v1/messages<br/>(multimodal content)<br/>HTTP(S)/8000
    Sidecar->>Encode: Fan-out multimodal content<br/>HTTP(S) TLS (configurable)
    Encode-->>Sidecar: ec_transfer_params
    Sidecar->>Prefill: Forward with ec params<br/>HTTP(S)
    Prefill-->>Sidecar: kv_transfer_params
    Sidecar->>Decode: Decode request +<br/>KV + EC params<br/>HTTP(S)/8001
    Decode-->>Sidecar: Streaming tokens (SSE)
    Sidecar-->>Gateway: Stream response
    Gateway-->>Client: Streaming tokens
